---
source: crates/odx-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Push the migration branch checked out and open its pull request: to the remote when you may push there, else to your fork (created when missing)

Usage: odx migrate pr [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -C, --project-dir <DIR>
          Run as if started in DIR

      --push-remote <NAME>
          Push to this remote instead of the migrated one or your fork

  -c, --config <FILE>
          The pyproject.toml or repos.yaml to use

      --ready
          Open the pull request ready for review instead of as a draft

  -j, --jobs <N>
          Override the number of parallel jobs

      --offline
          Serve forge and index data from the cache only

      --fresh
          Ignore cached data; refresh everything before answering

      --no-refresh
          Use cached data even when stale

      --refresh-index
          Rebuild the addon index for the series involved

      --json
          Machine-readable output on stdout

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase log verbosity (repeatable)

  -q, --quiet
          Errors only

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
